status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40039BA5185FBA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064301049:1":{"text":"クルル様の名を気安く呼びやがるとは、何と無礼な……","source_cn":"大胆，竟敢直呼库露露大人的名讳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D19D7EC81C17E3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1064301050:1":{"text":"まあまあ、バク。どうも頭のネジが何本か外れてるみたいだし、今回は許してあげましょ。","source_cn":"算了算了，阿爆，这铁块头的脑子好像不太聪明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A616B700EFF6A9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064301051:1":{"text":"それに、火力のことはけっこう分かってるみたいだしネ。これからはクルル様って呼ぶのヨ！","source_cn":"不过，看你也是个懂火力的家伙嘛，就不跟你计较了。以后得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA49C80E713F920D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1064301052:1":{"text":"で、アイドルであるアタシに会いたかったのは分かったけど、それだけじゃないんでしょ？他人の招待状まで持ち歩いて。","source_cn":"说吧，除了见偶像以外，到这儿来干嘛，还拿着别人的邀请函...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB63219602327CBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064301053:1":{"text":"ここ、「大会、無制限」\n最大火力、検証したい。","source_cn":"竞赛，无限制。\\n顶级火力，验证。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x057D00468AC2971D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064301054:1":{"text":"プッ……ドワーフやニンゲンに張り合うなんて……まあ火力へのこだわりはソートウだし、ギリ納得してあげる。","source_cn":"噗……你想跟那些矮人、人类比做武器？哈哈哈！勉强说得过去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x955ECD0D1A5C8BD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064301055:1":{"text":"でも、さっきいきなりブッ放してきた一発、アレにはめっちゃムカついてるんだけど！","source_cn":"不过，你刚才轰我那一炮，让我很不爽。非常、非常不爽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77065F81CDC992A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:82:1064301056:1":{"text":"だから、ここはアタシたちのルールに従ってもらう。なにか気の利いたミツギモノを持ってくるのヨ。そしたら許してあげてもいい。","source_cn":"按照我们那儿的规矩，你得赔点好处，让我心情好受些，才能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04A621C645F181A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064301057:1":{"text":"レトゥムは黙ったままクルルを見つめていた。どうやら、彼女の言う「ルール」が理解できないようだ。","source_cn":"勒图姆沉默地看着库露露，似乎不明白她所说的规矩是什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5184512201BF4B99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064301058:1":{"text":"はぁ～？アンタ、ホントにカタストロフ？別にタダでミツギモノを差し出せとは言ってないのヨ。代わりに、アンタの参加をなんとかしてあげるって言ってんの。","source_cn":"你到底是不是我们那儿的，怎么除了打