":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:98:1064301069:1":{"text":"あの人、なんか事故で顔がスゴイことになってるけど、鍛冶の腕は確かヨ……あと、招待状は急用で来れなくなったトモダチのものだって。","source_cn":"是个工坊出过事故的工匠，脸毁容了，性格就有点古怪。邀请...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EA5697F846AA939","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:99:1064301070:1":{"text":"まあ、美人コンテストじゃないんだし、見た目なんてカンケーないよネ！","source_cn":"反正是比拼武器制造嘛，又不是选美，长成什么样有什么关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x140C3E131C875C63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:100:1064301071:1":{"text":"えっ、それだけ？でもクルルが知らないヤツの肩を持つなんて、怪しいな……","source_cn":"就这么简单？帮陌生人说好话，可不常见呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB0BEBD76D74F5CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:101:1064301072:1":{"text":"アハッ、やっぱバレた？だって、アタシのオモチャを改造してくれるっていうから……","source_cn":"哎呀，就知道瞒不了你。他给了我点好处，帮我改造了个小玩意儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x744489471426A2FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:102:1064301073:1":{"text":"義理堅いカタストロフとしては、しょうがなく助けてあげようと思ったワケ。","source_cn":"作为具有感恩之心的恶魔，我就只好帮帮他咯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x761D10EC6E930F9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female"